            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It can fit a weight-loss diet: 130 calories, 18 g of protein and 5 g of fiber per serving help a shake feel filling for its calories. Note that the label itself says to use it as a food supplement only and not for weight reduction. No powder causes weight loss by itself, so count it within your daily calories and protein."
