              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Treating one serving as a full protein dose</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Each ALOHA serving is two level scoops with 18 g of protein. If your target is 25 to 30 g after training, one serving falls short, and you need about three scoops. Plan your canister count around that, because a 15-serving tub becomes roughly ten full-dose shakes.
