              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Paying the brand-site price without checking Amazon</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                On November 21, 2026, one canister cost $32.99 on aloha.com but $22.99 on Amazon from ALOHA's own storefront, a gap of about $0.92 per 25 g of protein. Check both before you buy, and compare autoship discounts against the Amazon price.
